component_spad_camera
=====================

The SPAD sensor model in `src/spad_model.py` is a port of the photon-detection
core of spadSim by David Rodriguez-Martinez, used and redistributed here under
the terms of its MIT License, reproduced below. The surrounding ROS 2 node
(TCP receiver, lifecycle plumbing, digitised reconstruction publishing) is
original to this repository and is offered under the same MIT terms.

    Upstream: https://github.com/drodriguezSRL/spadSim

Related work (from the spadSim repository):

    "Fast Vision in the Dark: A Case for Single-Photon Imaging in Planetary
    Navigation", arXiv:2510.10597.


